Farming references (@farming-sources: 0, #part-of @farming) { r_3Y2340J1G65F0B140KR0K63GJD
Primary agricultural references selected for this Trail. Research date: 2026-10-25. The explanations are original summaries; linked books and pages remain with their publishers. Read species instructions together with the shared lifecycle and adapt regional dates, densities, cultivars, and systems to the site.

Use older manuals for biological and production context. Current pesticide registrations, veterinary protocols, movement restrictions, food-processing rules, and conservation permissions require the relevant local authority. No historical chemical schedule is prescribed here. Resource metadata below enables optional download of selected original PDFs; ordinary bibliography hyperlinks are not automatic download dependencies.
} r_3Y2340J1G65F0B140KR0K63GJD

